This product includes software developed by Vyges.

This repository contains build tooling and a small MIT `vyges-emap` driver. It
produces reproducible x86_64 builds of that driver linked against mockturtle
(https://github.com/lsils/mockturtle, MIT, EPFL), which is not affiliated with
Vyges. Each built tarball ships mockturtle's license as LICENSE.mockturtle plus a
manifest.json recording the exact upstream commit. The driver additionally links
fmt (MIT) and abseil (Apache-2.0).
